- `bridge/view`: the textbook phrase "vectors of the form `λ x` with `λ > 0` and `x ∈ ri C`" is
  canonically expressed by the pointwise scalar-action set
  `𝕜>0 • ri[𝕜](C)` (where `𝕜>0 := Set.Ioi (0 : 𝕜)`); the
  homogenization cone description `Convex.intrinsicInterior_homogenizationCone_eq`,
